WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:10.060
<v Narrator>One breezy morning, Pooh laid out a picnic:</v>
<v Narrator>a cloth, a pot of honey,</v>

2
00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:13.280
<v Narrator>and a space just the size of a Piglet!</v>

3
00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:16.800
<v Piglet>“For me?”</v> <v Narrator>asked Piglet.</v>

4
00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:19.020
<v Pooh>“For us,”</v> <v Narrator>said Pooh.</v>

5
00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:23.210
<v Narrator>But the wind, it seemed,</v>
<v Narrator>wanted to come too.</v>

6
00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:30.310
<v Narrator>So off they went, over the heather</v>
<v Narrator>and under the pines,</v>

7
00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:33.370
<v Narrator>with the bees close behind,</v>
<v Narrator>just in case.</v>

8
00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:38.970
<v Pooh>“Perhaps…”</v> <v Narrator>said Pooh,</v>
<v Pooh>“it knows somewhere nicer.”</v>

9
00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:44.630
<v Narrator>It did.</v>

10
00:00:47.550 --> 00:00:50.350
<v Narrator>It wasn’t quite the picnic Pooh had planned.</v>

11
00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:55.460
<v Narrator>But with Piglet beside him,</v>
<v Narrator>it was a perfectly wonderful afternoon.</v>

